🎮 How to Play
Select an Element: Choose categories from the top tab bar (Powders, Liquids, Gases, Solids, Life, Food, Minerals, etc.) and pick an element from the bottom palette.

Brush Controls: Adjust your brush size using the range slider. Use the Heat or Cold tools to manipulate temperatures directly.

Actions:

Left-click + drag on the canvas to paint elements.

Use Pause to freeze simulation ticks while setting up complex experiments.

Use Lookup to search every element's properties and interaction chart.

Save and load your creations using the local storage slots (1, 2, 3).

🛠️ Built With
Vanilla JavaScript (ES6+)

HTML5 Canvas (Pixel-manipulation rendering buffer via Uint32Array)

CSS3 (Responsive design with automatic dark/light mode support)
